 style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">7</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_8\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">8</span></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;\">\n<td align=\"center\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Join_our_cult.\" title=\"Join our cult.\">Join our cult.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Butter_in_the_microwave.\" title=\"Butter in the microwave.\">Butter in the microwave.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Five_miles_per_day.\" title=\"Five miles per day.\">Five miles per day.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Quisps.\" title=\"Quisps.\">Quisps.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Another spoon.</strong></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bready_bready_bready.\" title=\"Bready bready bready.\">Bready bready bready.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_cuddle.\" title=\"A cuddle.\">A cuddle.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shaqinahat.\" title=\"Shaqinahat.\">Shaqinahat.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Don%27t_like_them_go_bang.\" title=\"Don&#39;t like them go bang.\">Don't like them go bang.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Think_about_the_spirit.\" title=\"Think about the spirit.\">Think about the spirit.</a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Another spoon.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/6/68/Another_spoon..png/revision/latest?cb=20210321095409\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Another spoon.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/6/68/Another_spoon..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210321095409\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/6/68/Another_spoon..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210321095409 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/6/68/Another_spoon..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20210321095409 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Another spoon.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Another_spoon..png\" data-image-name=\"Another spoon..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_9\" title=\"Series 9\">9</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">5</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jo_Brand\" title=\"Jo Brand\">Jo Brand</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Quisps.\" title=\"Quisps.\">Quisps.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bready_bready_bready.\" title=\"Bready bready bready.\">Bready bready bready.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Another spoon.</b></i> is the fifth episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_9\" title=\"Series 9\">Series 9</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Dave\" title=\"Dave\">Dave</a> on 2 October 2019. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Jo_Brand\" title=\"Jo Brand\">Jo Brand</a>. This episode featured <a href=\"/wiki/Kerry_Godliman\" title=\"Kerry Godliman\">Kerry Godliman</a>, who stood in place for <a href=\"/wiki/Katy_Wix\" title=\"Katy Wix\">Katy Wix</a> in the studio segments.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Another_spoon.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"I'm gonna put another spoon on\" was how <a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a> imagined <a href=\"/wiki/David_Baddiel\" title=\"David Baddiel\">David Baddiel</a>'s mind worked, during the <a href=\"/wiki/Lasso_Alex\" title=\"Lasso Alex\">Lasso Alex</a> task. The title card shows a watch and some broken eggs, referencing <a href=\"/wiki/Make_the_most_accurate_and_inventive_egg_timer\" title=\"Make the most accurate and inventive egg timer\">Make the most accurate and inventive egg timer</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Another_spoon.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'En slev mere', which translates as 'One more spoon'. The word 'slev' is an old fashioned word for 'spoon'. Danish people tend to use the word 'ske' instead.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Vielä yksi kauha', which translates as 'One more ladle'.</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Enda en sleiv.', which translates as 'Another wooden spoon'. Note: this Norwegian translation of the title only appears in the subtitles for the episode, whereas the episode title listed on the platform is the original English title.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Another_spoon.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/David_Baddiel\" title=\"David Baddiel\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">David Baddiel</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Gamble\" title=\"Ed Gamble\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Ed Gamble</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Jo_Brand\" title=\"Jo Brand\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Jo Brand</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Katy_Wix\" title=\"Katy Wix\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Katy Wix</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Rose_Matafeo\" title=\"Rose Matafeo\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Rose Matafeo</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Best_defunct_thing\" title=\"Best defunct thing\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Best defunct thing.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Lasso_Alex\" title=\"Lasso Alex\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Lasso Alex. You must stand behind this line at all times.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Make_the_most_accurate_and_inventive_egg_timer\" title=\"Make the most accurate and inventive egg timer\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Make the most accurate and inventive egg timer. After which, Alex will boil an egg for as long as your egg timer lasts. The Taskmaster likes his eggs runny, but not too runny. You may not use any pre-existing timing devices.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" class=\"tmtablerow\"><a href=\"/wiki/Get_to_know_this_person\" title=\"Get to know this person\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team:</b> Get to know this person. You will be tested on your knowledge of this person in ten minute's time. You may not write anything down or leave the lab. You must take it in turns to ask completely different questions. The person will tell the truth, lie, then brag, in that order, but not necessarily starting with the truth.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>4</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>4</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>4</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><small><i><b>Bonus:</b> Recreate the person's 'big tongue' party trick.</i></small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>1</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Kerry&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Kerry-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Build_the_highest_tower_of_bricks_on_the_table_behind_you\" title=\"Build the highest tower of bricks on the table behind you\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Looking at your mirrors and facing forward at all times, build the highest tower of bricks on the table behind you.\n<p>You must stay on your spot and use your litter pickers at all times.\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Kerry&#95;1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Kerry-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>12\n</td>\n<td>14\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">19\n</td>\n<td>16\n</td>\n<td>18\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>Notes</b>\n</p>\n<div class=\"references-small\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Kerry-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-Kerry_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-Kerry_1-1\">1.1</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">These points were attributed to Katy but won by <a href=\"/wiki/Kerry_Godliman\" title=\"Kerry Godliman\">Kerry Godliman</a>, who replaced her for the studio segments of this episode.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Another_spoon.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://taskmaster.tv/shows/another-spoon\"><i>Another spoon.</i> on Taskmaster website</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.channel4.com/programmes/taskmaster/on-demand/71678-005\"><i>Another spoon.</i> on All 4</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Another_spoon.?veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: References\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"references-small\">\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCa